    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19628" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάτος</span></b>  (A) [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], ἡ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bramble, Rubus ulmifolius,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				24.230
			</span></i>, Aen. Tact.<i><span class="en">
				28.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				1.132
			</span></i>; ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.112
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				754
			</span></i> (
				Att.
			 acc. to Moeris), <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.5.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				3.2
			</span></i>: whence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τοῦ</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς</span>
			)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> βάτου</span> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
				12.26
			</span></i>: fem., <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				20.37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. Ἰδαία</span>”
				<i>raspberry, Rubus Idaeus,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					4.38
				</span></i>
			; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ὀρθοφυής</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.18.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. Μοσυλῖτις,</span> a kind of
				<i>cassia,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλένιον</span>
			, <i>elecampane,</i> Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.28
			</span></i>.</div>
